      "name": "GetTileDataWord",
      "signature": "ushort GetTileDataWord(int nHandle)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "ushort",
      "comment": "Get tile data word value from handle.\\n\\nAlgorithm:\\n1. Check if nHandle parameter is NULL (zero)\\n2. If NULL, call InitTileResource with g_hTileHandle, g_szSourcePath, and 0x82 flags\\n3. Read and return ushort at offset +4 from nHandle\\n\\nParameters:\\n- nHandle (int): Handle value cast as pointer to tile data; if zero triggers initialization\\n\\nReturns:\\n- ushort: Word value at handle+4 offset representing tile data field\\n\\nMagic Numbers:\\n- 0x82: Initialization flags for tile resource loading\\n- +4: Byte offset to word data field in tile handle structure",
