      "name": "DerefAndValidatePointer",
      "signature": "dword DerefAndValidatePointer(dword * pdwValue)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "dword",
      "comment": "Validates pointer and returns dereferenced value, asserting on NULL.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if pdwValue is NULL\n2. If NULL: call assertion/error handler with file/line info and error code 0x7e\n3. Return dereferenced value from pdwValue\n\nParameters:\n- pdwValue (dword*): Pointer to 32-bit value to validate and dereference\n\nReturns:\n- Dereferenced value from pdwValue on success\n- Undefined behavior if pdwValue is NULL (assertion fires)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x7e (126): Error/assertion code passed to InitTileResource",
