      "name": "RemoveGfxNodeFromPaletteCache",
      "signature": "void RemoveGfxNodeFromPaletteCache(dword * pGfxNode)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Remove a graphics node from the palette cache linked list.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. If surface release callback is registered, validate node's surface pointer (offset 0x20)\n2. Call release callback with surface handle (offset 0x4 from surface pointer)\n3. Remove node from palette cache linked list\n\nParameters:\n- pGfxNode (dword*): Pointer to graphics node structure to remove\n\nReturns:\n- void\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x20: Offset to surface pointer in graphics node structure\n- 0x4: Offset to surface handle within surface data\n- 0xb2 (178): Assertion line number for null surface check",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
