      "name": "AssertCmpInitialized",
      "signature": "void AssertCmpInitialized(uint dwFlags)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Asserts CMP library is initialized before operations.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if dwFlags (init state) is zero\n2. If zero: trigger FogAssertFail with error 0x3f6 (1014) then terminate\n3. If non-zero: call Ordinal_10043 for post-init validation (error 0x3f7)\n4. Return normally\n\nParameters:\n- dwFlags (uint): Init state flag (0=uninitialized triggers assert)\n\nReturns:\n- void (terminates process if uninitialized)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x3f6 (1014): CMP serialization init error code\n- 0x3f7 (1015): Post-init validation code",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
